# What Atlas's code index (symbols, chunks, embeddings) leaves out beyond
# .gitignore and its built-in skips. Gitignore syntax; a `!` line re-includes
# something a built-in rule skipped.

# The engine is first-party code (ADR-0003), not a vendored dependency: index
# it despite the built-in `vendor/` skip.
!vendor/atlas-engine/
